==Dock==
[[File:Highlands Dock.png|right|300px]]
The first area once traveling via boat, it is home to fishing in the river and after rescuing the Highlands Dwarf, a shop partially up the stairs to the left. 

==Highlands Dwarf's Shop==
[[File:HighlandsDwarf Portrait.png|80px|right|link=]]
A narrow walkway straying west of the path connecting the dock and the [[Highlands Outpost|Outpost]] is the [[Highlands Dwarf Shop]], which is unlocked after freeing them from the [[Highlands Cavern]] with a [[Golden Key]] obtained from a slain [[Bully Rex]]. They sell a variety of cosmetic, mineral-adjacent furniture.

==Highlands Outpost== 
[[File:Highlands Outpost.png|thumb|]]
Located right above the path leading from the docks near Marlon's Boat, the [[Highlands Outpost]] is where [[Lance]] patrols the Highlands and its features. Blue, mystical flames are scattered around the Outpost, repelling enemies from moving too close. The Outpost building located at the top of the stairs near the docks to the far east of the map.

