==Crystal Cavern== 
[[File:Highlands Cavern in spring.png|thumb]]
Beyond the deep woods, far northwest of the [[Highlands Outpost|Outpost]], lies the entrance to the [[Highlands Cavern]]. It is infested with shadow monsters, rock crabs, plentiful ore, and [[Gemfish|valuable fish interlaced with gemstones]] swimming in its subterranean water bodies. It cages the [[Highlands Dwarf]] before the player emancipates them with a [[Golden Key]].

